 SG_ Odometer : 16|32@1+ (0.1,0) [0|999999] "km" TestTool
 SG_ FuelLevel : 48|8@1+ (0.5,0) [0|100] "%" TestTool

BO_ 768 BrakeData: 4 ECU1
